  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Config & flow",
      "items": [
        "User picks symbol, market (NSE/SEC), agent, model, web search; POST /analysis creates a PENDING run, then Inngest runs the pipeline (concurrency 5, retries 2)",
        "Agent markdown resolves to skills via resolveSkillsForAgent; Voyager data is pulled fresh before any analysis"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Skill analyst turns",
      "items": [
        "Each skill runs its own agent turn under SKILL_ANALYST_SYSTEM_PROMPT with the investor persona injected",
        "Tool use is forced on step 0; facts may come only from in-session tool results, copied verbatim, with mandatory citations; gaps are honest INSUFFICIENT verdicts",
        "Analyst toolset: Voyager financials/filings/announcements/transcripts, market news, Reddit, YouTube, PDF reading, web search"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Deterministic score & report",
      "items": [
        "The model never scores: YES/PARTIAL/NO verdicts per anchor are scored in code, with coverage gating the headline",
        "SKILL_REPORT_SYNTHESIS_SYSTEM_PROMPT narrates the computed numbers; a numeric-integrity sanitizer drops any figure no tool observed",
        "Report + per-skill scores + raw observations persist to analysis_runs; the result page renders hero score, skill cards, and sources"
      ]
    }
  ]
